    <string name="ui_gmail_integration">Gmail Integration</string>
    <string name="ui_gmail_integration_desc">Cognify will access Gmail messages after you grant authorization. Email content may be transmitted to Cognify\'s backend and third-party AI services for the Smart Inbox / Email Analysis feature, to identify and summarize relevant opportunities. This data is not used for advertising, unrelated profiling, or unrelated features. The requested access is limited strictly to providing this described functionality.</string>
    <string name="ui_document_analysis_privacy">Document Analysis</string>
    <string name="ui_document_analysis_desc">When you analyze a document, the selected PDF is sent to Cognify\'s backend for processing and may be transmitted to third-party services (such as OCR.space and NVIDIA AI services) for text extraction and analysis. The handling of this content is subject to the applicable providers\' terms and privacy practices.</string>
    <string name="ui_local_data_storage">Local Data Storage</string>
    <string name="ui_local_data_storage_desc">Your tasks, notes, calendar events, and app preferences are stored locally on your device. Any files you choose to export are also saved locally to your device storage.</string>
    <string name="ui_account_deletion">Account &amp; Data Deletion</string>
    <string name="ui_account_deletion_desc">You can permanently delete your account at any time from Settings > Delete Account. This action deletes your Firebase Authentication account, all your Firestore cloud data, and all local app data (including profile photos and active sessions). For assistance, contact krctstu@gmail.com.</string>
